    "Remove %lld selected %@?" : {
      "comment" : "Confirmation dialogs for bulk actions on places and saves. The first argument is the message that appears in the dialog title. The second argument is a Boolean binding that determines whether the dialog is currently presented. The third argument is the visibility of the dialog title. The fourth argument is a closure that is triggered when the \"Remove places\" button is tapped. The fifth argument is a closure that is triggered when the \"Delete",
