          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You saved %lld items across %lld areas, including %@." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how many items and areas of interest have been saved based on a specific pattern. The first argument is the count of saved items. The second argument is the count of areas of interest. The third argument is a list of up to two area names, joined appropriately.",
